  "_about": [
    "Fake demo data. All people, companies, and receipts are made up.",
    "employees: the people who submit claims.",
    "past_claims: older claims that were already paid. They give the agent a history to search (for duplicates and yearly limits).",
    "claims: the 20 new claims waiting for review. Each has an 'expected' answer, the correct outcome under data/policy.json.",
